# Lepší Rozvrh — scheduled jobs on a self-hosted server.
#
# On Vercel these ran as GitHub Actions workflows calling /api/cron/*. A server
# inside the school network is usually not reachable from GitHub, so the jobs
# run locally instead. Nothing is exposed and no CRON_SECRET is needed.
#
# Install with:  crontab -e   (as the user that owns the deployment)
# Docker:        prefix each command with
#                docker compose -f /srv/lepsi-rozvrh/docker-compose.yml exec -T app
#
# Adjust APP_DIR to where the project lives.
#
# TIME ZONE: cron reads the schedule below in the SYSTEM time zone. The TZ line
# only sets the jobs' environment (most cron daemons, e.g. Debian/Ubuntu cron,
# ignore it for scheduling). Check and set the system zone once:
#     timedatectl                                   # "Time zone: Europe/Prague (CET, +0100)"
#     sudo timedatectl set-timezone Europe/Prague
# The app computes reminders in Europe/Prague itself; this only matters for
# WHEN cron starts the jobs.

APP_DIR=/srv/lepsi-rozvrh
TZ=Europe/Prague
# Recorded as trigger 'cron' in the runs collection (admin / measurements).
RUN_TRIGGER=cron
MAILTO=""

# Download timetables from Bakaláři and detect changes — every 15 minutes.
*/15 * * * *  cd $APP_DIR && /usr/bin/node scripts/run-prefetch.js >> /var/log/lepsi-rozvrh/prefetch.log 2>&1

# Send push notifications for the changes found above — every 5 minutes.
*/5 * * * *   cd $APP_DIR && /usr/bin/node scripts/process-notifications.js >> /var/log/lepsi-rozvrh/notifications.log 2>&1

# "Next lesson" reminders — every minute on school days, 7:00-17:59.
# The windows run from 7:04 (0th lesson, 7:10) to 17:39 (12th lesson, 17:40);
# the old "7-15" stopped at 15:59 and lessons 11 and 12 never got a reminder.
* 7-17 * * 1-5  cd $APP_DIR && /usr/bin/node scripts/send-lesson-reminders.js >> /var/log/lepsi-rozvrh/reminders.log 2>&1

# Prune delivered-reminder records, processed changes and runs older than 30 days — nightly.
17 2 * * *    cd $APP_DIR && /usr/bin/node scripts/cleanup.js >> /var/log/lepsi-rozvrh/cleanup.log 2>&1
